# VWA setup transient artifacts (setup_vwa.sh wget -O writes to caller CWD;
# normally rm'd post `docker load`, but interrupted runs leave 50-90GB files
# in repo root — explicit guard to prevent accidental commit).
/shopping_final_*.tar
/postmill-populated-*.tar
/wikipedia_en_all_*.zim
/classifieds_docker_compose.zip

# Live state — synced via Tailscale rsync, NOT git
# (PLAYBOOK is regenerated every 30min/2h by GLM cron; pushing through git
# would spam history with 60+ commits/day; Windows-side Task Scheduler scp
# pulls fresh content every 1-2min over Tailscale instead)
docs/checkpoints/PLAYBOOK.md

# Cells frontmatter — cron */10min updates auto fields (status/progress/
# sr_raw/last_run_id/pid/history). Manual semantic fields (blocker/eta/
# priority) edited on DGX via VSCode Remote-SSH; Windows is read-only viewer.
docs/checkpoints/_status/cells/*.md

# Weekly reports + dashboard React app — local advisor-share + dev workspace,
# not paper-grade artifacts. Heavy churn (npm, generated HTML), and the source
# weekly markdowns can be re-derived from 笔记 chronicle if needed. Keep on
# disk for advisor email use, just not in git.
docs/checkpoints/周报/

# Defense-in-depth: any node_modules anywhere (subdir .gitignore handles this
# for known dirs but a top-level rule prevents future accidents)
node_modules/

# Cross-AI audit scratch space (codex + gemini) — local prompts/outputs, not
# paper-grade artifacts. Prompts regenerated per task from conversation context;
# outputs (incl. *_FINAL_*.md reviews + raw trace logs) feed 实验笔记 / paper
# drafts and don't need independent version history. Kept on disk, not git.
docs/checkpoints/codex_prompts/
docs/checkpoints/codex_outputs/
docs/checkpoints/gemini_prompts/
docs/checkpoints/gemini_outputs/
docs/checkpoints/process/

# A1.13 B-646 (P1-7): per-site:benchmark chain locks (flock TOCTOU defense)
.locks/
